hot 2024-12-04 182809.png", "id": "1085149306258970", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75540506_1085149312925636_6131579653421489203_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mqNJORcQMjcQ7kNvwFQYMEd&_nc_oc=AdrTs9zkEDUxBEVeNV2dGfmzZ_590BPaiae4ItunbTH8v5xKBPHTdr2Gbu5s4cwX-oc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFa3TJfiqjUtW0VqNS_rU66PxFWtGgt-34qF_tTAPs0Mg&oe=6A89883C"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2024-12-04 183005.png", "id": "4213717535527766", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75375749_4213717538861099_4020599651298427082_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-39aBylRuigQ7kNvwE5HPTY&_nc_oc=Ador2kbVrKA-ZR8-Jtjnkkv0GGhWcbh-VsRPFp85575pbNkdyHoHZop-2_dq8qsb218&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEc34TkwYRxvTAGuT1-nT4ZdV4XcTpomz0BHsTJg64eAA&oe=6A89990D"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2024-12-04 183241.png", "id": "499640243131183", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569446_499640246464516_3150957488509734960_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OWljxVPsSbYQ7kNvwEKXXnr&_nc_oc=AdqyMLWeiQ06zo4Gf79LL7yi26TVzKqPfbQhbmNHeiriJbbkshtQfEDWUXa003TNgD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHJ6LFNKd48O3OFGH7TkFV6T8OLiuXjwgq2rLHHdpna0g&oe=6A8991DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "GoofyOofer", "keywords": [], "long_description": "GoofyOofer is a Multiplayer Horror VR Game where you play as a Chimp and can only move with your hands with NO LEGS!! You also have lots of opportunities like exploring a cave with monsters inside and going deeper inside down to a secret lab with more monsters, you can also play TAG with other Chimps! or just be in a casual game mode with other chimps. You can also go shopping and get new Clothes and Hats and More! Welcome to GoofyOofer! Play now for free.", "short_description": "GoofyOofer is a Multiplayer Horror VR Game w